		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Hidden Pistol</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — A concealed pistol shot that ignores Rushed Attack rules.</em></p><p><strong>1 Action.</strong> Reach 2. Make an attack with a pistol, ignoring Rushed Attack rules.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Make an attack against all enemies in Reach 2, ignoring Rushed Attack rules.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Firearms have +1 Ammo.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Rolls a pistol attack against each targeted enemy (target every enemy in Reach 2).</em></p><p><em>[M] Ignores Rushed Attack rules.</em></p>",
